TI  - Morphologic adverse effects in hyperacute exposition to water-based mud in Hydractinia symbiolongicarpus (Hydractiniidae)
T2  - ACTA BIOLOGICA COLOMBIANA
LA  - English
KW  - Drilling muds
KW  - Hydrozoa
KW  - offshore platforms
