TI  - A forgotten element of the blue economy: marine biomimetics and inspiration from the deep sea
T2  - PNAS NEXUS
LA  - English
KW  - GREEN FLUORESCENT PROTEIN
KW  - CORAL LOPHELIA-PERTUSA
KW  - NATURAL-PRODUCTS
