TI  - Analysis of critical thresholds for environmental impacts of deep-sea mining plumes in polymetallic nodule areas
T2  - ACTA OCEANOLOGICA SINICA
LA  - English
KW  - SPONGE GEODIA-BARRETTI
KW  - DRILL CUTTINGS
KW  - SUSPENDED SEDIMENT
